Package: estimandYLL
Title: Years of Life Lost via the G-Formula
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Shuntaro", "Sato",
      email   = "shuntaro.sato.stat@gmail.com",
      role    = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6055-3649")
    )
Author: Shuntaro Sato [aut, cre] (ORCID:
    <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6055-3649>)
Maintainer: Shuntaro Sato <shuntaro.sato.stat@gmail.com>
Description: Estimates years of life lost as the difference in restricted
    expected residual lifetime between two binary exposure scenarios on the
    attained-age scale. A pooled logistic parametric g-formula standardizes
    individual conditional survival curves over an explicitly selected
    baseline population. Includes Poisson and Royston-Parmar model comparators,
    participant bootstrap confidence intervals, and plotting helpers.
